      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Transfer news",
          "heading": "Uruguayan Flanker Lucas Bianchi Completes Move To Italian Club Viadana",
          "body": "Uruguayan international Lucas Bianchi has joined Serie A Elite side Viadana. The 25-year-old flanker, who represented Los Teros at the 2023 Rugby World Cup, moves to Italy following a stint as a key member of the leadership team at Peñarol. Bianchi is one of several Uruguayan players securing contracts in Europe ahead of the 2027 Rugby World Cup cycle, bolstering the Viadana pack for the upcoming season in Italy’s premier domestic division."
        },
