    "390": {
      "date": "2026-09-27",
      "edition": "Sunday 27 September",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Match report",
          "heading": "Scotland Women Suffer Defeat After Overturning Lead Against Australia side",
          "body": "Scotland Women were unable to secure a victory in their final WXV Global Series fixture, falling to a defeat against Australia. Despite establishing a first-half lead, the side was undone by ill-discipline as the visitors successfully overturned the deficit. This result concludes a challenging tournament for the Scots, who had previously faced heavy losses against Canada and New Zealand earlier in the series, though they did manage to accumulate 40 points across their opening two encounters."
        },
        {
