    "391": {
      "date": "2026-09-27",
      "edition": "Sunday 27 September",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "WXV match report",
          "heading": "Wales women suffer narrow defeat against USA at Cardiff Arms Park",
          "body": "Wales women’s resurgence suffered a blow on Saturday as they were edged 24-26 by a clinical USA side in their WXV Global Series contest. Despite tries from Keira Bevan, Kelsey Jones, Sisilia Tuipulotu and Alex Callender, the hosts were unable to contain USA number eight Freda Tafuna, who secured a decisive hat-trick. The visitors dominated the second half, leaving Wales to refocus before their upcoming fixture in Japan next month. This result halts momentum following last week’s impressive win over South Africa."
        },
