          "kicker": "Match preview",
          "heading": "Les Kiss eyes tactical breakthrough against world champion Springboks in Perth",
          "body": "Coach Les Kiss enters his first Test match against a traditional rugby power this Sunday, describing the fixture as a \"massive, massive Test match.\" Facing the reigning world champions, Kiss has adjusted his starting lineup, shifting Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii to the wing to utilise his aerial prowess against a formidable opponent. With the countdown to the home World Cup beginning, the Wallabies look to test their development against a Springboks side featuring 10 World Cup winners."
