          "heading": "Ireland Women rule out Aoife Wafer for Sakura XV Test match",
          "body": "The Sakura XV face a revised Ireland side in Galway this Sunday after the hosts confirmed that back row Aoife Wafer has been ruled out of the encounter due to a minor injury sustained in training. The Irish have made six changes to their starting lineup following their opening defeat to the USA, including the inclusion of Eilís Cahill in the front row and Brittany Hogan in the pack. Japan continues their WXV Global Series campaign seeking an improved performance."
